  "details": "To allow editing language that needs IME (Input Method Editor), please enable IME composition on comment node text field. An example of such language is Japanese that is my mother language.\nAt the end of UdonComment constructor, add this lines:\n_textField.RegisterCallback<FocusInEvent>(evt => { Input.imeCompositionMode = IMECompositionMode.On; });\n_textField.RegisterCallback<FocusOutEvent>(evt => { Input.imeCompositionMode = IMECompositionMode.Auto; });\nRelated article (in Japanese) https://virtualcast.jp/blog/2020/04/playwithgraphview/",
